**/*.quarto_ipynb

# iCloud/multi-device sync-conflict duplicates (macOS appends " 2", " 3", etc.
# to a file when it sees simultaneous edits from two Macs). These should
# never be tracked -- if one of these shows up, it means two devices edited
# the same file at once and the real conflict needs resolving by hand, not
# committing both copies. See claude/course_site_design_philosophy.md in the
# Teaching project for the fuller multi-device-workflow notes.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9]

# Stray root-level site_libs/ from a render that ran outside the project
# context -- the real build output's site_libs/ lives under docs/ (this
# project's output-dir) and stays tracked.
/site_libs/
